sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI as Voice UI
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant Graph as LangGraph Agent
    participant Match as Matching Service
    participant Todo as Todo Service
    participant Log as Time Log Service
    participant DB as Database

    User->>UI: "I completed the loan API bug"
    UI->>API: Send transcript or audio result
    API->>Graph: Run progress update graph
    Graph->>DB: Load active tasks for today
    DB-->>Graph: Active tasks
    Graph->>Match: Compare spoken item with tasks
    Match-->>Graph: Best match and confidence
    alt High confidence
        Graph->>Todo: mark_completed(task_id)
        Todo->>DB: Update task status and completed_at
        Graph->>Log: create_time_log(task_id)
        Log->>DB: Insert time log
        Graph-->>API: Completed and remaining tasks
    else Ambiguous match
        Graph-->>API: Ask user to confirm candidate
    end
    API-->>UI: Response
    UI-->>User: Shows result

